  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital Orlando | Maitland, FL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Orlando Maitland, FL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOrlando\nMaitland, FL\nEmergency and Specialty\n407.644.1287\n9905 S U.S. Hwy. 17-92\nMaitland, FL 32751\n[email protected]\nMon-Fri:\n7 am-6 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Orlando - serving Central Florida.\nOur highly trained clinicians provide compassionate care for pets in the greater Orlando area, including the Winter Park, Sanford, Clermont, The Villages and Tavares communities.\nOur advanced facility is conveniently located in Maitland on 17-92, just a few miles east of the Maitland Boulevard and I-4 exit.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nOur experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Orlando.\nAppointment information\nAppointment scheduling\n– To schedule an appointment, call us between 7 am and 6 pm Monday through Friday at 407.644.1287. If you must cancel, please call at least 24 hours in advance of your scheduled appointment time.\nHospitalized patients\n– For your pet’s well-being, our hospital is staffed 24 hours a day. The front desk is open Monday through Friday 7 am to 6 pm and Saturday 7 am to 1 pm.\nNew patients\n– New patients are generally scheduled between 8 am and 2 pm. Your pet's primary veterinarian may make your first appointment for you if you wish. All patients are returned to the care of their primary veterinarians when specialty treatment is complete.\nSurgical patients\n– If your pet is scheduled for surgery,\ndownload and read our pre-operative instructions.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n407.644.1287\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n407.644.1287\n407.644.9075\n9905 S U.S. Hwy. 17-92\nMaitland,\nFL                                    32751\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrandon, FL\n607 Lumsden Professional Ct.\nBrandon, FL 33511\n813.571.3303\n75.51 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nTampa, FL\n3000 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa, FL 33614\n813.933.8944\n80.78 miles\nBluePearl Pet Surgery\nTown ‘n’ Country\nTampa, FL\n7512 Paula Dr\nTampa, FL 33615\n813.901.5100\n85.87 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
